window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-63929697ad7bb73a"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"business-operations\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">业务运营</h1> <blockquote> <p>如需查看完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。将 <code>.md</code> 附加到页面 URL 后，可查看该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>将项目背景和指标转化为可用于决策的工作成果。</p> <p>使用 ChatGPT Work 或 Codex 汇总项目跟踪表、KPI 仪表板、规划文档、会议记录和相关方背景。ChatGPT 可以把这些运营资料整理成便于审阅的简报、决策材料、模型和进展更新，同时清楚呈现假设与待确认问题。</p> <p><a id=\"keep-initiatives-moving\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">推动项目持续前进</h2> <p>准备周期性的项目健康状况更新；如果项目可能偏离计划，则查明原因，并明确需要作出的决定、负责人和后续行动。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/strategic-initiative-health-update\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备项目健康状况更新（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供项目跟踪表、项目文档、KPI 变化、以往简报、负责人记录和决策……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/initiative-off-track-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">撰写项目偏离计划简报（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供管理层的要求、项目文档、KPI 仪表板、跟踪表、财务模型……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"prepare-decisions-and-tradeoffs\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">准备决策并比较取舍</h2> <p>将研究和相关方讨论整理成有来源依据的决策备忘录，再基于明确的假设、成本、时间、风险和影响比较不同战略方案。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/research-to-decision-memo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">将研究整理成决策备忘录（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供研究材料、规划文档、模型、仪表板、相关方背景以及……</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scenario-tradeoff-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">建模比较战略情景与取舍（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供财务模型、KPI 仪表板、规划文档、市场背景和相关方……</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"report-company-progress\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">汇报公司进展</h2> <p>根据经批准的项目跟踪表、指标、负责人说明和以往材料，制作公司、管理层或董事会报告材料包。</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cfo-board-reporting-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">准备管理层报告材料包（本地尚未收录）</a>：向 ChatGPT 提供上一版报告、进度大纲、项目跟踪表、KPI 和预测输入……</li> </ul>","en":"<h1 id=\"business-operations\">Business Operations</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Turn initiative context and metrics into decision-ready work.</p> <p>Use ChatGPT Work or Codex to bring together project trackers, KPI dashboards, planning documents, meeting notes, and stakeholder context. ChatGPT can turn that operating record into reviewable briefs, decisions, models, and updates while keeping assumptions and open questions visible.</p> <h2 id=\"keep-initiatives-moving\">Keep initiatives moving</h2> <p>Prepare a recurring health update, or diagnose an initiative that may be slipping and clarify the decision, owners, and next actions needed.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/strategic-initiative-health-update\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare an initiative health update (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT the tracker, initiative docs, KPI changes, prior briefs, owner notes, decision...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/initiative-off-track-brief\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Write an initiative off-track brief (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT the executive ask, initiative docs, KPI dashboards, tracker, financial model...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"prepare-decisions-and-tradeoffs\">Prepare decisions and tradeoffs</h2> <p>Turn research and stakeholder debate into a sourced decision memo, then compare strategic paths with explicit assumptions, costs, timing, risks, and impact.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/research-to-decision-memo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Turn research into a decision memo (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT research, planning documents, models, dashboards, stakeholder context, and...</li> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/scenario-tradeoff-model\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model strategic scenarios and tradeoffs (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT a financial model, KPI dashboard, planning docs, market context, stakeholder...</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"report-company-progress\">Report company progress</h2> <p>Build a company, leadership, or board reporting pack from approved initiative trackers, metrics, owner commentary, and prior materials.</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/use-cases/cfo-board-reporting-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Prepare a leadership reporting pack (not in this local snapshot)</a>: Give ChatGPT the prior pack, progress outline, initiative trackers, KPI and forecast inputs...</li> </ul>"};
